> Take collaboration to a higher level. This cafe-height stool is made for[ all-]body comfort, with a foot-ring for leg support, and contoured seat back for back support. A four-leg base adds structural support. Wherever people migrate in your office, this stool is there to support them.
Dimensions: 21.81"D x 18.0"W x 40.88"H.
Weight capacity: Up to 300lbs.
Comes in 200+ colors and fabrics.[][][][][][][]

