> Featuring wooden arms hand crafted from 100% renewable bamboo wood and a soft feel finish, these custom sunglasses make a stylish and affordable promotion! These sunglasses provide 100% UV protection and feature shatter resistant lenses. Price includes your imprint on both sunglass arms, and your choice of four frame colors.
5 3/4" x 2" x 6"[][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]

